{{!
    @template local_ada/chat_drawer

    Panel lateral flotante de chat interactivo para ADA en cursos autorizados.
}}
<style>
#ada-chat-toggle {
    position: fixed;
    right: 20px;
    bottom: 22px;
    z-index: 1040;
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    padding: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(15, 108, 191, 0.35);
    transition: transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease;
}
#ada-chat-toggle:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.06);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(15, 108, 191, 0.45);
}
#ada-chat-drawer {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 390px;
    max-width: 95vw;
    height: 100vh;
    z-index: 1050;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-left: 1px solid #dee2e6;
    box-shadow: -4px 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transform: translateX(100%);
    transition: transform 0.22s ease-in-out;
}
#ada-chat-drawer.ada-open {
    transform: translateX(0);
}
#ada-chat-messages {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 12px;
    background: #f8f9fa;
}
.ada-msg {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    padding: 9px 12px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.38;
    max-width: 92%;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    word-break: break-word;
}
.ada-msg-user {
    background: #0f6cbf;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-left: auto;
}
.ada-msg-bot {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
    color: #212529;
    margin-right: auto;
}
</style>

<button id="ada-chat-toggle" type="button" class="btn btn-primary" aria-label="Abrir Asistente ADA" title="Asistente ADA">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 64 64" width="38" height="38" aria-hidden="true">
        <!-- Orejas / Penachos -->
        <path d="M16 12 L24 18 L18 24 Z" fill="#ffffff"/>
        <path d="M48 12 L40 18 L46 24 Z" fill="#ffffff"/>
        <!-- Cuerpo / Cabeza -->
        <path d="M16 26 C16 17, 48 17, 48 26 L49 42 C49 51, 41 56, 32 56 C23 56, 15 51, 15 42 Z" fill="#ffffff"/>
        <!-- Ojos grandes -->
        <circle cx="25" cy="29" r="7.5" fill="#0f6cbf"/>
        <circle cx="39" cy="29" r="7.5" fill="#0f6cbf"/>
        <circle cx="25" cy="29" r="4.5" fill="#ffffff"/>
        <circle cx="39" cy="29" r="4.5" fill="#ffffff"/>
        <circle cx="25.8" cy="28.5" r="2.2" fill="#1b2a4a"/>
        <circle cx="39.8" cy="28.5" r="2.2" fill="#1b2a4a"/>
        <!-- Pico -->
        <path d="M29 33 L35 33 L32 39 Z" fill="#f59e0b"/>
        <!-- Pecho / Plumas -->
        <path d="M24 44 Q32 50 40 44" fill="none" stroke="#0f6cbf" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <path d="M27 49 Q32 53 37 49" fill="none" stroke="#0f6cbf" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>
</button>

<aside id="ada-chat-drawer" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center px-3 py-2 bg-primary text-white">
        <div>
            <div class="fw-bold">ADA — Asistente Docente</div>
            <small class="opacity-75">Generador de preguntas (XML / GIFT)</small>
        </div>
        <div>
            <a href="{{fullworkspaceurl}}" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-light me-1" title="Vista completa">↗</a>
            <button id="ada-chat-close" type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-light" aria-label="Cerrar">×</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="ada-chat-messages">
        <div class="ada-msg ada-msg-bot">
            Hola. Escríbeme el <strong>tema o contenido</strong> y te genero preguntas de opción múltiple listas para descargar e importar manualmente en tu Banco de preguntas.
        </div>
    </div>

    <form id="ada-chat-form" class="p-2 border-top bg-white">
        <div class="row g-1 mb-2">
            <div class="col-3">
                <select id="ada-chat-count" class="form-select form-select-sm" title="Cantidad">
                    <option value="1">1 preg.</option>
                    <option value="3" selected>3 preg.</option>
                    <option value="5">5 preg.</option>
                </select>
            </div>
            <div class="col-3">
                <select id="ada-chat-diff" class="form-select form-select-sm" title="Dificultad">
                    <option value="basic">Básico</option>
                    <option value="intermediate" selected>Medio</option>
                    <option value="advanced">Avanz.</option>
                </select>
            </div>
            <div class="col-3">
                <select id="ada-chat-format" class="form-select form-select-sm" title="Formato">
                    <option value="moodle_xml" selected>XML</option>
                    <option value="gift">GIFT</option>
                </select>
            </div>
            <div class="col-3">
                <select id="ada-chat-provider" class="form-select form-select-sm" title="IA">
                    <option value="auto" selected>Auto</option>
                    <option value="gemini">Gemini</option>
                    <option value="openrouter">OpenRouter</option>
                </select>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="input-group">
            <textarea id="ada-chat-input" class="form-control form-control-sm" rows="2"
                placeholder="Ej.: Árboles binarios de búsqueda (recorridos y complejidad)..."></textarea>
            <button id="ada-chat-send" type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Enviar</button>
        </div>
    </form>
</aside>

